    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThe Green Door is a three-bedroom end of terrace residence that comes to the market in showhouse condition having been completely refurbished in 2026 to an exceptionally high standard throughout, yet keeps some of its old word charm. \n\nWith a floor area of approximately 80sqm/861sqft, ground floor accommodation comprises of an entrance hall with motion sensor lighting, living room with restored fireplace and sea views, a solid ash kitchen with a modern spray finish and corian worktops, integrated appliances and floating shelf. Off the kitchen is a dining room which offers side access to the property and also access to the courtyard.\n\nFirst floor consists of three bedrooms, two to the front of the property with water views and the master with carpeted floor and a feature restored fireplace. The shower room has stunning porcelain tiles and additional sensor lighting. \n\nUpgrades to the property include a Mitsubishi Heat Pump, timber sash windows, timber doors, new floors and carpets, insulation, plumbing and electrics. The quality of finish of this property is second to none. \n\nExternally, there is a back lit courtyard with anti-slip stairs to the second level and a maintenance free astro turf finish.\n\nThe property is extremely well located, within a minute's walk from Westport Quay and its harbour and Westport House. The Quay area is an attractive, pedestrian-friendly area, and home to a number of restaurants, bars, hotels and local shops, including a small supermarket 50 metres from the house. Westport town centre and its many amenities are a short 10-minute walk away"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.4m x 1.2m\nNatural oak laminate floor, painted carpeted staircase, motion sensor ceiling lights\n\nLiving Room - 3.66m x 3m\nNatural oak laminate floor, open fire, sea views\n\nKitchen - 3.45m x 3m\nNatural oak laminate floor, solid ash painted kitchen, corian worktops, integrated electric oven/hob, fridge/freezer and dishwasher, extractor fan, motion sensor lighting\n\nDining Room - 4.7m x 2.7m\nNatural oak laminate floor, storage press, door to side entrance, door to courtyard\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 3m x 0.8m & 2.2m x 0.8m\nCarpeted floor, motion sensor ceiling lighting\n\nBedroom One - 4.32m x 2.25m & 0.6m x 0.5m\nNatural oak laminate floor\n\nBedroom Two - 3.1m x 1.9m\nNatural oak laminate floor, part wallpapered\n\nBedroom Three - 3.19m x 3m\nCarpeted floor, feature fireplace, sea views\n\nShower Room - 2.7m x 1.54m\nPorcelain tiled floor and feature backsplash tiling, shower, heated towel rail, sensored lighting, wc, whb\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Completely refurbished and modernized 3-bedroom end of terrace residence</li><li>A-Rated property in turn key condition.</li><li>New heating, plumbing, electrics, windows, floors, doors insulation, kitchen, bathroom. </li><li>Mitsubishi Heat Pump and restored fireplace</li><li>Back lit courtyard to rear</li><li>Exceptional location at Westport Quay</li><li>Close to all local amenities</ul>"
      },
